s3.content:
Nawah is a family-organization app. After creating an account, you can create or join one or more "families" — private groups of users who share content with one another. Inside a family you can:

• send chat messages, photos, videos, and voice notes;
• create and assign tasks, calendar events, shared lists, polls, and announcements;
• upload files (photos, PDFs, videos, notes) to a shared family vault;
• share your live location on a family map while the app is open;
• ask the AI Assistant for planning help.

Content you create inside a family is visible to every current member of that family. Treat anything you post in a family as shared with the whole family.

