Every chat message has a long-press menu with Report and Block user actions. You can review and unblock blocked users at any time from Settings → Blocked Users.

Reports are routed to our moderation team and reviewed within 24 hours. We may, at our sole discretion and without prior notice:

• remove or hide content that we believe violates these Terms;
• suspend or permanently terminate the account of any user who violates these Terms;
• cooperate with law-enforcement authorities where required by law.

We are not obligated to monitor all content, but we reserve the right to do so. We are not responsible for content you encounter that is created by other users.

s8.content:
The AI Assistant uses Google Gemini to generate suggestions and help draft tasks, events, and lists. You acknowledge that:

• responses are generated by AI and may be inaccurate, incomplete, or out of date — you should verify important details;
• the AI does not make changes to your data without your explicit confirmation;
• prompts you submit are sent to Google for processing as described in the Privacy Policy.

Do not rely on the AI Assistant for medical, legal, financial, or other professional advice.
